{%- comment -%}
  Single source of truth for price formatting: ₹399, never "Rs. 399.00".
  Shopify's store currency format still says "Rs. {{amount}}", so we normalise
  here rather than depending on an admin setting that can drift.
  Usage: {% render 'gc-money', price: product.price %}
{%- endcomment -%}
{{- price | money_without_trailing_zeros | replace: 'Rs. ', '₹' | replace: 'Rs.', '₹' | replace: '₹ ', '₹' -}}
